==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Sho Ayanokoji (Enemy)|Sho Ayanokoji]] spawns as the boss after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.
*1 [[Hikaru Saotome (Enemy)|Hikaru Saotome]] spawns after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>.
*1 [[Hitomi Saionji (Enemy)|Hitomi Saionji]] spawns.
*1 [[Hoshi Grandmarnier (Enemy)|Hoshi Grandmarnier]] spawns after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>.
*1 [[Shouchikubai Shiratori (Enemy)|Shouchikubai Shiratori]] spawns after 18 seconds<sup>540f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage has a very basic strategy, which is meatshields + ranged units. As long as you have up to 4 meatshields and long-ranged units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]], you will easily win.

